00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:08,030
Let's see.

235
00:14:08,810 --> 00:14:10,250
You're a Capricorn.

236
00:14:10,730 --> 00:14:15,470
It says that you'll be feeling stress at work, but you could see new exciting developments in your love life.

237
00:14:16,110 --> 00:14:17,690
Looks like we'll both have interesting summers.

238
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:24,760
That's bogus. I don't feel any stress at work, and my love life is practically non-existent.

239
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:26,820
This zodiac stuff is all a bunch of nonsense.

240
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:28,120
No it's not.

241
00:14:28,580 --> 00:14:31,400
Your astrology sign can tell you a lot about your personality.

242
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:36,260
See, it says that an Aries is energetic and loves to socialize.

243
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:41,920
Well, you certainly match those criteria, but they're so broad they could apply to anyone.

244
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:43,820
What does it say about me?

245
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,940
A Capricorn is serious-minded and practical.

246
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:49,600
She likes to do things in conventional ways.

247
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,560
That sounds just like you!

248
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:57,930
Alright, so talk about the horoscopes.

249
00:14:58,110 --> 00:14:58,690
Which sign are you?

250
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:01,210
I'm a Leo, which is actually...

251
00:15:01,210 --> 00:15:07,050
I don't believe in the horoscope, but I have to say, every time someone tells me about Leos, Leo the Lion, right?

252
00:15:07,830 --> 00:15:10,810
I agree with most of their descriptions of my personality.

253
00:15:11,350 --> 00:15:21,590
So, outspoken, loves to socialize, very opinionated, which means I have an opinion and I don't like to listen to other people, loves to argue very loud.

254
00:15:22,410 --> 00:15:27,650
So these are all qualities that I think I have, and some of them are bad, some of them are good, but you know, that's the way it is.

255
00:15:28,410 --> 00:15:35,850
But you don't really believe in what magazines or newspapers say about your outlook?

256
00:15:36,290 --> 00:15:37,030
Nah, I don't...

257
00:15:37,310 --> 00:15:39,840
yeah, the predictions are usually just basic guesses.

258
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:41,780
But what about you?

259
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:42,540
What's your sign?

260
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:46,760
I am a Taurus, so I was born in May.

261
00:15:47,180 --> 00:15:47,700
A bull.

262
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:48,780
A bull, yes.

263
00:15:49,020 --> 00:15:51,380
So I'm very stubborn and very strong.

264
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:56,820
I don't really know what all the characteristics about the Taurus are.

265
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:58,200
Opinionated?

266
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:59,200
Opinionated, I know that it's stubborn.

267
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:00,200
Loves to argue?

268
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:01,200
Yeah, exactly.

269
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,200
Doesn't like to be corrected?

270
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:05,200
Are you describing Taurus or are you describing me?

271
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:05,720
Both.

272
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:23,780
All right, so it's actually very interesting. I think in many ways, sometimes the glove does fit and someone's zodiac sign describes them very well. But again, maybe like the dialogue says, they are very broad descriptions that basically any person can relate to.

273
00:16:24,160 --> 00:16:30,400
Absolutely. I think that that's one of the tricks to horoscopes or to predicting someone's future.

274
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:36,040
You tell them enough very vague things that maybe some of them will fit and some of them won't.

275
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:37,040
That's right.

276
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:44,940
But I'm very curious to hear about you guys. What are your signs? What's your sign? That means what's your zodiac sign?

277
00:16:44,940 --> 00:16:49,440
That's right. That's actually also a very common date question people say, oh, what's your sign?

278
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:50,440
Or a pickup line.

279
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,440
Or a pickup line.

280
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,440
Hey baby, what's your sign?

281
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:54,080
To see if you're compatible, right?

282
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:56,060
Right. So let us know.

283
00:16:56,300 --> 00:16:57,480
We're not trying to pick you up.

284
00:16:57,620 --> 00:16:58,100
We're just curious.

285
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:03,120
You'll find a lot of the words for the zodiac in today's lesson on our website, EnglishPod.com.

286
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:03,600
All right.

287
00:17:03,700 --> 00:17:04,220
We'll see you guys there.

288
00:17:04,460 --> 00:17:04,640
Bye.
